      "@type": "kto:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Operational Excellence Pillar",
      "skos:definition": "The pillar of the AWS Well-Architected Framework concerned with running and evolving workloads to deliver business value, built on eight design principles and four best practice areas (Organization, Prepare, Operate, Evolve) covering questions OPS 1 to OPS 11.",
