      "skos:prefLabel": "IAM policy evaluation logic",
      "skos:definition": "The rules AWS applies to every authenticated request to decide allow or deny: start from an implicit deny, let any applicable explicit Deny win, require an Allow from each guardrail policy type (RCPs, SCPs, permissions boundaries, session policies), and combine identity-based and resource-based grants differently for same-account and cross-account requests.",
      "kto:domain": "identity-and-access",
