      "skos:definition": "How the U.S. government's FedRAMP cloud security program applies to AWS: AWS GovCloud (US) holds FedRAMP Certified Class D (formerly High) and the US East/West Regions Class C (formerly Moderate), scoped per service, with agencies still issuing their own ATOs on top of inherited controls.",
