      "@id": "kt:amazon-guardduty",
      "@type": "kto:Service",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Amazon GuardDuty",
      "skos:definition": "AWS's managed threat detection service, which continuously analyzes CloudTrail management events, VPC flow logs and DNS logs, plus optional protection plans for S3, EKS, runtime, malware, RDS, Lambda and AI workloads, and reports suspicious activity as findings per Region.",
